return {
    ["        纵观罗塞尔大帝的传奇一生，除了陆地上的革新与统治，他也是海洋上的传奇与霸主。 \n        他充满探索欲和开拓精神，带领舰队在五海的风暴中探索。他发现了狂暴海中的安全航道，开启了对南大陆的殖民时代。无论是为了黄金还是资源，无论是为了探索还是掠夺……不可否认的是，罗塞尔对于海上航道的探索，为这个世界开启了一个新的时代。\n         伴随着争议、奴役、罪恶和咒骂，五海之上的将军与王者们，曾歌颂他的名；借助安全航道，登上南大陆的殖民者们，曾歌颂他的名；从事南北大陆贸易，促进南北大陆通商的商人们，曾歌颂他的名。\n        他在冒险和开拓中，拓宽了这个世界的边界。"] = "        Looking back at the legendary life of Emperor Roselle, besides his innovation and rule on land, he was also a legend and hegemon on the ocean. \n He was full of desire for exploration and a pioneering spirit, leading his fleet to explore the storms of the Five Seas. He discovered the safe shipping lanes in the Berserk Sea and opened the colonial era of the Southern Continent. Whether for gold or resources, whether for exploration or plunder... it is undeniable that Roselle's exploration of sea routes opened a new era for this world. \n Accompanied by controversy, slavery, sin, and curses, the generals and kings of the Five Seas once sang his name; with the help of safe shipping lanes, the colonists who landed on the Southern Continent once sang his name; the merchants who engaged in trade between the Northern and Southern Continents and promoted commerce between them once sang his name. \n In adventure and pioneering, he broadened the boundaries of this world.",
